    {
      "id": "text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42,
      "y": 297.5,
      "width": 326,
      "height": 105.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a005",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 211017583,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 880837492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793886951364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① 本币指数｜A股日历\n沪深北、中证、中债、上金所\nt 日收盘点位；当日未发布\n→ 沿用最近披露日\n（中债 T 日 18:00 后发布，\n延迟则该要素日收益记 0）",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-2",
      "originalText": "① 本币指数｜A股日历\n沪深北、中证、中债、上金所\nt 日收盘点位；当日未发布\n→ 沿用最近披露日\n（中债 T 日 18:00 后发布，\n延迟则该要素日收益记 0）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "rect-3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
