    },
    {
      "id": "text-6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 422,
      "y": 297.5,
      "width": 326,
      "height": 105.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a007",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 364727202,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 909839653,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793886951364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② 非本币指数｜境外日历\n恒生、纳指100、MSCI、彭博等\n取最近已披露境外收盘 × 估值汇率\nRb = Cb(t)·H(t) / [Cb(t−1)·H(t−1)] − 1\n美股系：T+1 出具，\n取 T 日收盘（不滞后）",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-3",
      "originalText": "② 非本币指数｜境外日历\n恒生、纳指100、MSCI、彭博等\n取最近已披露境外收盘 × 估值汇率\nRb = Cb(t)·H(t) / [Cb(t−1)·H(t−1)] − 1\n美股系：T+1 出具，\n取 T 日收盘（不滞后）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
